{"3765910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zomb'Invasion", "steam_appid": 3765910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DIVE INTO THE ULTIMATE ZOMBIE EXPERIENCE!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 4 friends, fight back together — or against each other — through increasingly intense waves of zombies in ever-changing conditions thanks to mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MULTITUDE OF ZOMBIES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against zombies with <strong>insane abilities</strong>: explosions, poisoning, or even magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly and stay in control to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MUTATIONS</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutations are <strong>temporary changes</strong> that affect how you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple damage boosts to <strong>invincible zombies dancing through disco floors</strong>, you'll need to adapt constantly to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MAPS VARIETY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a wide range of environments: <strong>Paris</strong>, <strong>a desert island</strong>, an Abandonned Labo...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place is a good place to battle zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WEAPONS VARIETY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you’ll have the chance to purchase <strong>randomly selected weapons</strong> from a wide arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you need to <strong>obliterate the undead</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>GRENADES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingnite your games with <strong>unique-effect grenades</strong>: freeze, inversed controls, summon…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them wisely to dominate both zombies <strong>and other players</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 friends — <strong>eliminate zombies together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>COOPERATION MODE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to survive and eliminate as many zombies as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>VERSUS MODE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate... but compete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you’re the <strong>ultimate zombie exterminator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who will be crowned king?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>OTHER FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> – Fight with style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Rank</strong> – Show off your skills and dedication!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrades</strong> – Upgrade your weapons mid-game to survive longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DIVE INTO THE ULTIMATE ZOMBIE EXPERIENCE!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 4 friends, fight back together — or against each other — through increasingly intense waves of zombies in ever-changing conditions thanks to mutations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MULTITUDE OF ZOMBIES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against zombies with <strong>insane abilities</strong>: explosions, poisoning, or even magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly and stay in control to eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.poster.avif?t=1756488740\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.webm?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.mp4?t=1756488740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MUTATIONS</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutations are <strong>temporary changes</strong> t